BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[ATH] End of Summer Drive-In Movie Night: Toy Story 4
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260819T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260819T184500
DTSTAMP:20260711T070002Z
UID:smcl-6a513c78f4e5db3d00c0dabe@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Summer may be winding down\, but that doesn’t mean the party
  has to stop yet! Come enjoy a family movie at the library\, where we’ll
  be hosting an afternoon filled with fun and games\, arts and crafts\, and
 \, of course\, a great film to close out the evening. First\, join us earl
 y at 4 PM to play giant-sized games\, build your own cardboard car for our
  special movie night\, and try other fun tie-in crafts. Then\, “drive”
  outside to our Makerspace Deck for the screening to start at 5 PM. All ag
 es are welcome! \n\nWe’ll be watching Toy Story 4: “Woody has always b
 een confident about his place in the world...and that his priority is taki
 ng care of his kid\, whether that’s Andy or Bonnie. But when Bonnie adds
  a reluctant new toy called “Forky” to her room\, a road trip adventur
 e alongside old and new friends will show Woody how big the world can be f
 or a toy.” (1h 40m)\n\nAges: 6-11\nRegistration: none\nSource: https://s
 mcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a513c78f4e5db3d00c0dabe\nLast synced: 2026-0
 7-11 00:00 PDT
LOCATION:Atherton Library\, 2 Dinkelspiel Station Ln\, Atherton\, CA 94027
URL:https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a513c78f4e5db3d00c0dabe
END:VEVENT
