SUMMARY:[SC] Family Campout
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260807T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260808T100000
DTSTAMP:20260711T070002Z
UID:sancarlos-1050@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Families can participate in this community event by pitching a
  tent and camping under the stars in Burton Park! This is a great way to g
 ather with friends and enjoy a variety of activities\, including crafts\, 
 field games\, s'more roasting\, star walk (must register)\, and a movie at
  dusk! Barbecue dinner and continental breakfast are included. Families sh
 ould bring camping equipment\, including a tent and sleeping bag\, as well
  as extras such as chairs\, snacks\, and flashlights.&nbsp\; Registration 
 is open. &nbsp\; Check-in begins Friday at 4:00 p.m. and check-out is Satu
 rday at 10:00 a.m. Registration is required. Children must be accompanied 
 by an adult. Please leave pets at home.\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https:/
 /www.cityofsancarlos.org/business_detail_T10_R30.php\nLast synced: 2026-07
 -11 00:00 PDT
LOCATION:Burton Park
